    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been two years since the invasion of alien bugs. Most of humanity was wiped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small group of remaining resistance received a distress call from the abandoned city Kvitopol. Some person, who call herself Princess, requested an evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Taras, one of the remaining resistance fighters. Taras has one simple job - to rescue this mysterious Princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Shoot alien bugs to make your way to Princess during action-packed episodes of the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Collect Alien Cores to upgrade your weapons and power up your attacks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Collect Gears and use your Fabricator to make drones, turrets, seeker mines and other useful stuff. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Find boxes with military Robots that can help you fight aliens along your way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Destroy alien outposts, different obstacles and power down alien energy barriers to move forward. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Destroy weird alien plants to clear weird dark energy field. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available weapons: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Burst Gun. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Automatic rifle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Foam gun. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabricator: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Attack Drone. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Turret. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Seeker mine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Static mine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Stunner. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been two years since the invasion of alien bugs. Most of humanity was wiped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small group of remaining resistance received a distress call from the abandoned city Kvitopol. Some person, who call herself Princess, requested an evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Taras, one of the remaining resistance fighters. Taras has one simple job - to rescue this mysterious Princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Shoot alien bugs to make your way to Princess during action-packed episodes of the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Collect Alien Cores to upgrade your weapons and power up your attacks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Collect Gears and use your Fabricator to make drones, turrets, seeker mines and other useful stuff. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Find boxes with military Robots that can help you fight aliens along your way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Destroy alien outposts, different obstacles and power down alien energy barriers to move forward. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Destroy weird alien plants to clear weird dark energy field. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available weapons: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Burst Gun. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Automatic rifle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Foam gun. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabricator: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Attack Drone. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Turret. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Seeker mine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Static mine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Stunner. </p></li></ul>",
